Psalm 103:1-5:
Praise Yahweh, my soul!
All that is within me, praise his holy name! Praise Yahweh, my soul,
and don’t forget all his benefits; who forgives all your sins;
who heals all your diseases; who redeems your life from destruction;
who crowns you with loving kindness and tender mercies; who satisfies your desire with good things,
so that your youth is renewed like the eagle’s.
